      { title: 'One toolchain, for people and agents', body: 'One nsh executable creates, builds, type-checks, hot-reloads, tests, packages and signs. Declarations are generated from the Rust sources and the docs are served as llms.txt, so an agent runs the whole loop with the same commands.', chips: 'nsh run, nsh test, nsh package', href: 'docs/getting-started' },
